  "field-guide-yhwh-three-go-up-go-anywhere-double-": "{{0}}<div class=\"eyebrow\">FIELD GUIDE / YHWH Three</div><h2>Go up. Go anywhere.</h2><p>Double-click a directory in Space or Files to enter it. Open a file to edit. Your shell follows the directory; a shell <code>cd</code> brings Files with it. Every focus tab has its own shell, directory and document.</p><div class=\"shortcuts\"><span>Files sidebar</span><kbd>Ctrl E</kbd><span>Focus file manager</span><kbd>Ctrl D</kbd><span>Terminal</span><kbd>Ctrl B / Alt Shift T</kbd><span>Parent directory</span><kbd>Alt ↑ / Backspace</kbd><span>Command palette</span><kbd>Ctrl P / Ctrl Shift P</kbd><span>New / close focus tab</span><kbd>Ctrl T / Ctrl W</kbd><span>Previous / next tab</span><kbd>Ctrl Shift Tab / Ctrl Tab</kbd><span>Save / pretty mode</span><kbd>Ctrl S / Ctrl Shift V</kbd><span>New file / rename</span><kbd>Ctrl N / F2</kbd><span>Hidden files</span><kbd>Ctrl H</kbd></div><p>Drag empty space to orbit. Scroll to zoom. File labels and the sidebar offer keyboard access to every object.</p><h3>About YHWH</h3><p>{{1}}</p><div class=\"dialog-buttons\"><button data-url=\"https://thedynamiclinker.com\">About Us ↗</button><button data-url=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HNQ23QKT\">About YHWH · Genesis ↗</button><button data-action=\"edit-voice\">Edit YHWH text</button></div>",
  "settings-local-gravity-make-yourself-at-home-the": "{{0}}<div class=\"eyebrow\">SETTINGS / LOCAL GRAVITY</div><h2>Make yourself at home.</h2><p>These controls apply to this focus tab. Persistent choices belong in your hierarchical <code>rc</code> and <code>rc.three</code> files.</p><form id=\"settings-form\"><label>Personality<select name=\"theme\">{{1}}</select></label><label>Bloom<input name=\"bloom\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"{{2}}\"></label><label>Motion<select name=\"motion\"><option value=\"1\" {{3}}>On</option><option value=\"0\" {{4}}>Still</option></select></label><label>Editor font size<input name=\"font_size\" type=\"number\" min=\"10\" max=\"32\" value=\"{{5}}\"></label><label>File type rules (JSON: filename regex → language)<textarea name=\"filetypes\">{{6}}</textarea></label><button class=\"primary\">Apply</button></form><h3>Configuration in effect</h3><p>{{7}}</p><button data-action=\"open-three-config\">Open rc.three</button>{{8}}<p class=\"muted\">Themes can use Obsidian CSS variables. Native Obsidian plugins need their own API and are not loaded here.</p>",
  "-settings-form-label": "#settings-form label",
  "offerings-a-little-fuel-for-creation-burnt-offer": "{{0}}<div class=\"eyebrow\">OFFERINGS</div><h2>A little fuel for creation.</h2><p>{{1}}</p><button data-action=\"burnt\" class=\"offering-card\"><i data-lucide=\"flame\"></i><span><strong>Burnt Offering</strong><small>Set up a donation link</small></span><i data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\"></i></button><button data-action=\"piece\" class=\"offering-card\"><i data-lucide=\"file-plus-2\"></i><span><strong>Piece Offering</strong><small>Choose a file to stage locally</small></span><i data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\"></i></button><p>{{2}}</p><button data-action=\"edit-voice\">Edit this voice</button>",
  "burnt-offering-developer-setup-connect-the-altar": "{{0}}<div class=\"eyebrow\">BURNT OFFERING / DEVELOPER SETUP</div><h2>Connect the altar.</h2><ol><li>Create a Stripe account using the button below.</li><li>In Stripe, create a product for donations and a Payment Link. Choose customer-entered amounts if available.</li><li>Use test mode first. Complete Stripe’s identity and business details, then connect the bank account that should receive payouts.</li><li>Copy the live Payment Link into the app’s offering action when ready. Keep secret API keys out of the renderer and repository.</li><li>For an upload website, add a server endpoint, size limits and storage, then connect Piece Offering. No upload is sent by this prototype.</li></ol><div class=\"dialog-buttons\"><button data-url=\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/register\">Create Stripe account ↗</button><button data-url=\"https://docs.stripe.com/payment-links\">Payment Links guide ↗</button><button data-url=\"https://thedynamiclinker.com\">Our website ↗</button></div><p>Payments and uploads are currently stubs. No payment is taken here.</p>",
  "commands-what-shall-we-do-": "{{0}}<div class=\"eyebrow\">COMMANDS</div><h2>What shall we do?</h2><input id=\"command-filter\" placeholder=\"Search commands or type a path…\" aria-label=\"Search commands\"><div id=\"command-results\"></div>",
